Package: fastPLSextra
Type: Package
Title: Iterative Solver Companion for fastPLS
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Stefano", "Cacciatore", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tkcaccia@gmail.com")
Description: GPL-licensed iterative singular value decomposition and partial
    least squares comparison tools. The PLS engines are shared with fastPLS
    through its native headers rather than copied. This development companion
    provides CPU double-precision IRLBA integration.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports: Rcpp, Matrix, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, Matrix, fastPLS (>= 0.99.39)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
